design_type.description:
Design dimensions configuration. Optional if asset_id provided. Must be a dictionary with 'type' field.

Two options:
1. Preset: {'type': 'preset', 'name': 'doc'|'email'|'whiteboard'|'presentation'}
2. Custom: {'type': 'custom', 'width': 1080, 'height': 1920}

Type must be either 'preset' or 'custom'. For preset, name must be one of: doc, email, whiteboard, presentation. For custom, width and height must be between 40-8000 pixels and their product must not exceed 25,000,000 pixels.
